sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client (connect)
  participant S as Server (accept)
  C->>S: banner «ceph v2\n» + len(16) + supported + required
  S->>C: banner
  C->>S: HELLO(entity_type, peer_addr)
  S->>C: HELLO
  C->>S: AUTH_REQUEST(method=cephx, preferred_modes, payload)
  S->>C: AUTH_REPLY_MORE (challenge)
  C->>S: AUTH_REQUEST_MORE
  S->>C: AUTH_DONE(global_id, con_mode, payload)
  Note over C,S: From here on: crc or secure (AES-128-GCM)
  C->>S: AUTH_SIGNATURE (HMAC over the exchanged bytes)
  S->>C: AUTH_SIGNATURE
  C->>S: CLIENT_IDENT(addrs, target, gid, global_seq, features, flags, cookie)
  S->>C: SERVER_IDENT
  C->>S: MESSAGE / KEEPALIVE2 / ACK ...
